# Where a level link fires, in every direction, from a fixed start (no timing drift).
# Each block: a server warp to a chosen spot, then one arrow key held until the
# link fires. Server warps put the player on a half-tile (the wire has half-tile
# resolution), and a step is half a tile, so every position is on that grid.
# lv_a.nw links: lv_c 10 28 2 5 (rectangle), lv_b 0 0 64 2, lv_w 0 62 64 2,
# lv_s 62 0 2 64. lv_s.nw has the west strip lv_a 0 0 2 64.
start lv_a.nw 30.00 30.50
wait 3
mark m1-Left-14.0_30.5-lv_a.nw
chat warpto 14.0 30.5 lv_a.nw
wait 2
click 500 300
wait 0.5
hold Left 1.2
wait 1
mark m2-Right-6.0_30.5-lv_a.nw
chat warpto 6.0 30.5 lv_a.nw
wait 2
click 500 300
wait 0.5
hold Right 1.2
wait 1
mark m3-Down-11.0_20.0-lv_a.nw
chat warpto 11.0 20.0 lv_a.nw
wait 2
click 500 300
wait 0.5
hold Down 1.2
wait 1
mark m4-Up-11.0_40.0-lv_a.nw
chat warpto 11.0 40.0 lv_a.nw
wait 2
click 500 300
wait 0.5
hold Up 1.2
wait 1
mark m5-Down-7.0_20.0-lv_a.nw
chat warpto 7.0 20.0 lv_a.nw
wait 2
click 500 300
wait 0.5
hold Down 1.2
wait 1
mark m6-Down-7.5_20.0-lv_a.nw
chat warpto 7.5 20.0 lv_a.nw
wait 2
click 500 300
wait 0.5
hold Down 1.2
wait 1
mark m7-Down-11.5_20.0-lv_a.nw
chat warpto 11.5 20.0 lv_a.nw
wait 2
click 500 300
wait 0.5
hold Down 1.2
wait 1
mark m8-Down-12.0_20.0-lv_a.nw
chat warpto 12.0 20.0 lv_a.nw
wait 2
click 500 300
wait 0.5
hold Down 1.2
wait 1
mark m9-Down-30.0_56.0-lv_a.nw
chat warpto 30.0 56.0 lv_a.nw
wait 2
click 500 300
wait 0.5
hold Down 1.2
wait 1
mark m10-Up-30.0_6.0-lv_a.nw
chat warpto 30.0 6.0 lv_a.nw
wait 2
click 500 300
wait 0.5
hold Up 1.2
wait 1
mark m11-Right-56.0_30.5-lv_a.nw
chat warpto 56.0 30.5 lv_a.nw
wait 2
click 500 300
wait 0.5
hold Right 1.2
wait 1
mark m12-Left-30.0_30.0-lv_s.nw
chat warpto 30.0 30.0 lv_s.nw
wait 2
click 500 300
wait 0.5
hold Left 1.2
wait 1
wait 2
